re marriage, were deemed allocated to him under their consent judgment. The court emphasized that the 2007 agreement waived further claims about community property.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-louisiana-man-acquired-an-early-stake-linked-to-raising-canes-before-marrying-in-2001-after-their-2007-divorce-settlement-his-former-wife-sought-a-share-of-the-interests-but-a-2026-appeals-court-rejected-her-claim/articleshow/135672349.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-louisiana-man-acquired-an-early-stake-linked-to-raising-canes-before-marrying-in-2001-after-their-2007-divorce-settlement-his-former-wife-sought-a-share-of-the-interests-but-a-2026-appeals-court-rejected-her-claim/articleshow/135672349.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-11T02:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135672527,imgsize-1996576.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[South Carolina's 229-acre White Tract to be conserved after 20-year fight against housing development]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135677793.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a remarkable show of environmental cooperation, a 229-acre tract in South Carolina will transition to permanent conservation after development plans were challenged. Concerns over wetlands, wildlife, and water quality catalyzed a settlement enabling the Open Space Institute to acquire land adjacent to the Cape Romain National Wildlife Refuge. This outcome is a triumph for conservation advocates who have dedicated years to preserve this vital ecological region.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/in-2006-a-developer-planned-more-than-200-homes-on-a-229-acre-south-carolina-tract-bordering-a-wildlife-refuge-after-20-years-of-opposition-it-has-agreed-to-sell-the-land-for-permanent-conservation/articleshow/135677793.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/in-2006-a-developer-planned-more-than-200-homes-on-a-229-acre-south-carolina-tract-bordering-a-wildlife-refuge-after-20-years-of-opposition-it-has-agreed-to-sell-the-land-for-permanent-conservation/articleshow/135677793.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-11T01:55:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135678037,imgsize-2377715.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Chemical tests suggest 3,000-year-old Spanish treasure contains meteoritic iron]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135706888.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/discovery/a-3000-year-old-spanish-treasure-contains-two-unusual-iron-objects-chemical-tests-suggest-they-may-have-been-crafted-from-metal-that-fell-to-earth-in-meteorites/articleshow/135706888.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/discovery/a-3000-year-old-spanish-treasure-contains-two-unusual-iron-objects-chemical-tests-suggest-they-may-have-been-crafted-from-metal-that-fell-to-earth-in-meteorites/articleshow/135706888.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-11T01:50:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135706982,imgsize-82930.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Florida appeals court lifts restrictions after wedding venue alleges noisy neighbour disruptions]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135676885.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Sydonie Mansion in Florida is currently embroiled in a legal dispute concerning disturbances during weddings. Neighbors Brad and Audrey Hatcher face allegations of making excessive noise and having uncontrolled dogs. In a recent ruling, a Florida appeals court overturned a lower court’s injunction due to a lack of evidence demonstrating irreparable harm, while the lawsuit over the nuisance claims continues to await resolution.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-florida-wedding-venue-accused-neighbours-of-disrupting-ceremonies-with-gunfire-chainsaws-and-revving-airboats-and-won-a-court-order-to-stop-them-in-october-2026-an-appeals-court-overturned-the-temporary-ban/articleshow/135676885.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-florida-wedding-venue-accused-neighbours-of-disrupting-ceremonies-with-gunfire-chainsaws-and-revving-airboats-and-won-a-court-order-to-stop-them-in-october-2026-an-appeals-court-overturned-the-temporary-ban/articleshow/135676885.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-11T00:59:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135676986,imgsize-2470311.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Circle K worker bought customer's abandoned lottery ticket after clocking out; it won $12.8 million, now a judge has allowed a legal fight]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135677193.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Robert Gawlitza, a former Circle K manager, found himself in a legal battle after purchasing a winning lottery ticket worth nearly $12.8 million, which was supposedly left unpaid by a customer. Circle K argues that the ticket should never have been sold, while Gawlitza claims he adhered to store procedures. This ongoing case aims to clarify who rightfully owns the lucky ticket.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-circle-k-worker-found-a-customers-abandoned-arizona-lottery-ticket-clocked-out-and-bought-it-himself-it-turned-out-to-be-worth-12-8-million-and-now-a-judge-says-the-fight-over-who-owns-it-can-go-ahead/articleshow/135677193.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-circle-k-worker-found-a-customers-abandoned-arizona-lottery-ticket-clocked-out-and-bought-it-himself-it-turned-out-to-be-worth-12-8-million-and-now-a-judge-says-the-fight-over-who-owns-it-can-go-ahead/articleshow/135677193.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-11T00:56:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135677355,imgsize-751695.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Batman chases thief and scales Norwich cathedral wall to return stolen handbag]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135706733.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-man-dressed-as-batman-chased-a-suspected-handbag-thief-through-norwich-then-scaled-a-high-cathedral-wall-to-retrieve-the-abandoned-bag-and-return-it-with-every-item-intact/articleshow/135706733.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-man-dressed-as-batman-chased-a-suspected-handbag-thief-through-norwich-then-scaled-a-high-cathedral-wall-to-retrieve-the-abandoned-bag-and-return-it-with-every-item-intact/articleshow/135706733.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-11T00:53:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135706904,imgsize-1127007.cms"/></item><item><title><!